[10.562, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[10.567, "o", "\u001b[0;36m> using podman container \u00b7 asking opencode \u00b7 using deepseek-v4-flash-free\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[13.067, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\n> build \u00b7 deepseek-v4-flash-free\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[15.567, "o", "\u001b[0m\u2699 \u001b[0mard-google-discovery_ard_search {\"query\":\"SQL query optimization best practices, query tuning, performance analysis\"}\r\n"]
[15.568, "o", "I'll search for tools covering both areas.\r\n"]
[15.612, "o", "\u001b[0m\u2699 \u001b[0mard-google-discovery_ard_search {\"query\":\"zero-trust security architecture design, identity and access management, secure access\"}\r\n"]
[18.112, "o", "Here are the best tool matches:\r\n\r\n**SQL query optimization**\r\n- `bigquery-guidelines` (skill, no auth) \u2014 SQL optimization, partitioning/clustering, schema design, window functions. *Best for query best practices.*\r\n- `database-design` (skill, no auth) \u2014 Postgres/AlloyDB/Spanner tuning, connection pooling, indexing.\r\n- `well-architected-cost-optimization` (skill, no auth) \u2014 BigQuery slot/query pricing optimization.\r\n- Managed MCP servers (need GCP auth): `bigquery` (dry-run + cost estimation), `cloud-sql`, `alloydb`.\r\n\r\n**Zero-trust security**\r\n- `well-architected-security` (skill, no auth) \u2014 Zero-trust architecture, IAM least-privilege audit, network perimeters, encryption policy. *Best for zero-trust design.*\r\n- `gke-architecture` (skill, no auth) \u2014 Network policies / security hardening for Kubernetes.\r\n- `firebase-architecture` (skill, no auth) \u2014 Declarative security rules.\r\n- `secret-manager` MCP (needs GCP auth) \u2014 secret rotation + IAM permission checks + audit logging.\r\n\r\nAll no-auth skills are ready to use offline. Want me to load the best-practices content from `bigquery-guidelines` and `well-architected-security`?\r\n"]
