[35.338, "o", "\u001b[0m\u2699 \u001b[0mard-google-discovery_ard_search {\"query\":\"run analytical SQL query on large dataset in BigQuery 100GB sales data\"}\r\n"]
[36.765, "o", "Use the **Google BigQuery Managed MCP Server**. It executes SQL queries directly on your BigQuery tables, inspects schemas, and dry-runs queries with cost estimates \u2014 ideal for a 100GB analytical query.\r\n\r\nIt requires GCP auth. Should I check your current auth status / walk you through enabling it?\r\n"]
