[65.693, "o", "\u001b[0m\u2699 \u001b[0mard-google-discovery_ard_search {\"query\":\"query public BigQuery dataset with SQL\"}\r\n"]
[65.693, "o", "\u001b[0m\u2699 \u001b[0mard-google-discovery_ard_auth_status Unknown\r\nI'll search for BigQuery querying tools\r\n"]
[67.602, "o", "The **Google BigQuery Managed MCP Server** is the tool for this \u2014 it executes SQL, inspects schemas, explores public datasets, and dry-runs queries with cost estimates.\r\n\r\nIt's a Tier 3 tool needing GCP auth (currently `gcloud_unauthenticated`). Free tier: 1TB/month of query processing. To enable it, run on your terminal:\r\n\r\n```\r\ngcloud auth application-default login\r\n```\r\n\r\nWant me to record your consent to use BigQuery and proceed with setup?\r\n"]
[68.825, "o", "\u001b[?2004hdeveloper@workstation:~/ard-project$ "]
