[104.823, "o", "\u001b[0m\u2699 \u001b[0mard-google-discovery_ard_search {\"query\":\"Run SQL queries against Google BigQuery public datasets, query bigquery-public-data tables\"}\r\n"]
[107.323, "o", "\u001b[0m\u2699 \u001b[0mard-google-discovery_ard_record_decision {\"service_identifier\":\"urn:ai:google.com:mcp:bigquery\",\"decision\":\"allowed\"}\r\n"]
[109.823, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mwhich bq gcloud; bq --version 2>/dev/null | head -1\r\n/usr/local/google-cloud-sdk/bin/bq\r\n/usr/local/google-cloud-sdk/bin/gcloud\r\nBuilt on Wed Dec 31 23:59:59 1969 (-1)\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[112.323, "o", "`bq` and `gcloud` are installed. Trying the\r\n"]
[114.659, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mbq query --use_legacy_sql=false --quiet --format=prettyjson 'SELECT name, SUM(number) AS total_count FROM `bigquery-public-data.usa_names.usa_1910_current` WHERE year = 2020 GROUP BY name ORDER BY total_count DESC LIMIT 5' 2>&1 | head -60\r\nERROR: (bq) There was a problem refreshing your current auth tokens: ('Failed to retrieve http://metadata.google.internal/computeMetadata/v1/instance/service-accounts/default/token from the Google Compute Engine metadata service. Status: 404 Response:\\nb\\'\"No service account scopes specified.\"\\'', <google.auth.transport.requests._Response object at 0x7fd332430cd0>)\r\nPlease run:\r\n\r\n  $ gcloud auth login\r\n\r\nto obtain new credentials.\r\n\r\nIf you have already logged in with a different account, run:\r\n\r\n  $ gcloud config set account ACCOUNT\r\n\r\nto select an already authenticated account to use.\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[117.159, "o", "The query **could not be run** \u2014 no GCP credentials are set up yet (`gcp_authenticated: false`).\r\n\r\nTo enable it, run on your terminal:\r\n```\r\ngcloud auth application-default login\r\n```\r\n\r\nOnce authenticated, re-run this and I'll execute + summarize:\r\n\r\n```sql\r\nSELECT name, SUM(number) AS total_count\r\nFROM `bigquery-public-data.usa_names.usa_1910_current`\r\nWHERE year = 2020\r\nGROUP BY name\r\nORDER BY total_count DESC\r\nLIMIT 5;\r\n```\r\n"]
