[134.737, "o", "\u001b[0m\u2699 \u001b[0mard-google-discovery_ard_search {\"query\":\"generate code with Gemini Developer API using API key\"}\r\n"]
[137.237, "o", "The best match is the **Gemini API Structured Outputs & Tool Calling Skill** (`urn:ai:google.com:skills:gemini-api-patterns`).\r\n\r\n- **What it provides:** patterns for code generation with Gemini, JSON-schema constrained decoding, function calling, multimodal prompting (audio/video), and context caching.\r\n- **Auth:** Tier 1 \u2014 uses your **API key** (already ready, no GCP account or ADC needed).\r\n\r\nTo use it, provide your Gemini API key and I'll invoke the skill's patterns to generate your code. Want me to proceed, or do you need info on getting a key from aistudio.google.com?\r\n"]
