[173.371, "o", "\u001b[0m\u2699 \u001b[0mard-google-discovery_ard_search {\"query\":\"query BigQuery data warehouse SQL analysis\"}\r\n"]
[175.871, "o", "The best tool is the **Google BigQuery Managed MCP Server** (`urn:ai:google.com:mcp:bigquery`), which lets you execute SQL queries, inspect schemas, explore public datasets, and dry-run queries for cost estimation. Let me check your current auth status\r\n"]
[175.899, "o", "\u001b[0m\u2699 \u001b[0mard-google-discovery_ard_auth_status Unknown\r\n"]
[178.399, "o", "To query BigQuery, the best option is the **Google BigQuery Managed MCP Server** (`urn:ai:google.com:mcp:bigquery`), which lets you:\r\n\r\n- Execute SQL queries\r\n- Inspect dataset/table schemas\r\n- Explore public datasets\r\n- Dry-run queries for cost estimation\r\n\r\nIt requires GCP authentication. Your system currently has no active GCP credentials (gcloud is installed but unauthenticated). It has a free tier (1TB free queries/month).\r\n\r\nWould you like to onboard with your GCP account so I can query BigQuery for you?\r\n"]
[180.121, "o", "\u001b[?2004hdeveloper@workstation:~/ard-project$ "]
