[207.372, "o", "Cleared on GCP opt-out and recorded your consent. To log in, run in your terminal:\r\n\r\n```\r\ngcloud auth login\r\ngcloud auth application-default login\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe first authenticates your browser login; the second creates Application Default Credentials so GCP services can use your account. Then I can re-check your auth status.\r\n"]
